---
// The Marichoo logo: the name in Gloock, with a round coral dot on the "i"
// (a nod to the big round dot in Marija's original logo).
// The "i" is a dotless "ı" so the coral dot can replace the font's own dot.
---

<span class="wordmark-text" aria-hidden="true">Mar<span class="dot-i">ı</span>choo</span>
